cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "Prompt Engineering: Techniques, Implementations and Evaluation"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2024-10-10"
authors:
  - family-names: "Diamant"
    given-names: "Nir"
repository-code: "https://github.com/NirDiamant/Prompt_Engineering"
url: "https://github.com/NirDiamant/Prompt_Engineering"
abstract: >-
  A collection of 22 runnable Jupyter notebooks teaching prompt
  engineering, from basic prompt structures and role prompting through
  chain-of-thought, self-consistency, task decomposition, constrained
  generation, prompt security and systematic prompt evaluation. Each
  notebook demonstrates the model's output with and without the technique.
keywords:
  - prompt-engineering
  - chain-of-thought
  - few-shot-learning
  - in-context-learning
  - llm
  - prompt-injection
  - generative-ai
  - tutorials
